      {
        "blocks": [
          {
            "context": "paragraph",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "For articles, the appendix must be defined as a level 1 section ("
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "=="
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "). For example:"
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          },
          {
            "context": "listing",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "= Article Title\n:appendix-caption: Exhibit\n:sectnums:\n:toc:\n\n== Section\n\n=== Subsection\n\n[appendix]\n== First Appendix\n\n=== First Subsection\n\n=== Second Subsection\n\n[appendix]\n== Second Appendix"
              }
            ],
            "language": "asciidoc",
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          },
          {
            "context": "paragraph",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "The table of contents will appear as follows:"
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          },
          {
            "context": "listing",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "1. Section\n  1.1. Subsection\nExhibit A: First Appendix\n  A.1. First Subsection\n  A.2. Second Subsection\nExhibit B: Second Appendix"
              }
            ],
            "language": "asciidoc",
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          },
          {
            "context": "paragraph",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "For books, the appendix must be defined as a level 1 section ("
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "=="
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": ") if you want the appendix to be a adjacent to the chapters. In a multi-part book, if you want the appendix to be adjacent to other parts, the appendix must be defined as a level 0 section ("
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "="
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "). In either case, the first subsection of the appendix must be a level 2 section ("
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "==="
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": ")."
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          },
          {
            "context": "paragraph",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "The following example shows how to define an appendix for a multi-part book."
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          },
          {
            "context": "listing",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "= Book Title\n:doctype: book\n:sectnums:\n:toc:\n\n= First Part\n\n== Chapter\n\n=== Subsection\n\n== Second Part\n\n== Chapter\n\n[appendix]\n= First Appendix\n\n=== First Subsection\n\n=== Second Subsection\n\n[appendix]\n= Second Appendix"
              }
            ],
            "language": "asciidoc",
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          },
